    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875820/extras/f5bf87b3385ccc80a6f17335203477e5.poster.avif?t=1745326095\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875820/extras/f5bf87b3385ccc80a6f17335203477e5.webm?t=1745326095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875820/extras/f5bf87b3385ccc80a6f17335203477e5.mp4?t=1745326095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pastel provides players with psychological fear of underwater or above-water objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players explore a blue space that is both beautiful and terrifying, looking for ways to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875820/extras/5ecc272214687d7b7504fcf1bb579b32.poster.avif?t=1745326095\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875820/extras/5ecc272214687d7b7504fcf1bb579b32.webm?t=1745326095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875820/extras/5ecc272214687d7b7504fcf1bb579b32.mp4?t=1745326095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes you'll have to solve puzzles to clear your way, and sometimes you'll have to fight creepy creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875820/extras/feca01b1fd16668dd07d2db23315f7f3.poster.avif?t=1745326095\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875820/extras/feca01b1fd16668dd07d2db23315f7f3.webm?t=1745326095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875820/extras/feca01b1fd16668dd07d2db23315f7f3.mp4?t=1745326095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can enjoy the story by reading past logs scattered around the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by submechanophobia and liminal space.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875820/extras/f5bf87b3385ccc80a6f17335203477e5.poster.avif?t=1745326095\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875820/extras/f5bf87b3385ccc80a6f17335203477e5.webm?t=1745326095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875820/extras/f5bf87b3385ccc80a6f17335203477e5.mp4?t=1745326095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pastel provides players with psychological fear of underwater or above-water objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players explore a blue space that is both beautiful and terrifying, looking for ways to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875820/extras/5ecc272214687d7b7504fcf1bb579b32.poster.avif?t=1745326095\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875820/extras/5ecc272214687d7b7504fcf1bb579b32.webm?t=1745326095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875820/extras/5ecc272214687d7b7504fcf1bb579b32.mp4?t=1745326095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes you'll have to solve puzzles to clear your way, and sometimes you'll have to fight creepy creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875820/extras/feca01b1fd16668dd07d2db23315f7f3.poster.avif?t=1745326095\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875820/extras/feca01b1fd16668dd07d2db23315f7f3.webm?t=1745326095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875820/extras/feca01b1fd16668dd07d2db23315f7f3.mp4?t=1745326095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can enjoy the story by reading past logs scattered around the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by submechanophobia and liminal space.</p>",
    "short_description": "Pastel is a FPS/TPS horror game where you experience a beautiful liminal space and sub-mechanophobia towards underwater and above-water objects.",
